<title>USA: Talbots says reaches $1 bln in annual sales.</title>
<headline>Talbots says reaches $1 bln in annual sales.</headline>
<dateline>HINGHAM, Mass. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Talbots Inc said it reached $1 billion in sales for the fiscal 1996 year.</p>
<p>Talbots did not project earnings.  A company spokeswoman declined to comment.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman said the company will release its fourth-quarter and fiscal 1996 results on March 25.</p>
<p>Talbots is a specialty retailer and cataloger of women's apparel, shoes and accessories.</p>
